      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sanctum Somnium [zone=758]\n**Who:**\n- Sage Jarith [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Cort Landerson [npc=36941]\n- Dennen Marol [npc=36983]\n- Fareth [npc=36963]\n- Mara O`Rane [npc=36973]\n- Rommen Steelforge [npc=36957]\n- Seager the Locksmith [npc=36932]\n- a tower warden [npc=36938]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Jarith #2: Dreamland Assault [quest=5246]\n- Jarith #3: The Key to the Tower [quest=5247]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 29 21:31:20 2010\nModified: Wed Jan 29 10:11:56 2025 | | _This is the first of three solo tasks in a series that begins with Sage Jarith in Sanctum Somnium. He's an Erudite that wanders around the entrance area of the zone. Beware of KOS mobs in his vicinity while talking to him._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sage Jarith'\nSage Jarith says 'Morell has us trapped here, but I believe there is a way out. I have a [plan]. If it is going to work though, I'll need your help, as well as any other captives in this bizarre dream world.'\nYou say, 'What plan is that?'\nSage Jarith says 'First, we'll need to [search] this tower and make contact with the rest of the people trapped here. Next, I'll need your help gathering components for a [device] that can dispel some of Morell's magic and hopefully weaken him. Finally, we'll use the device near that locked [tower] that seems so important. I have a feeling that's where Morell is hiding.'\nYou say, 'What about this tower?'\nSage Jarith says 'Oh, we aren't ready for the tower yet. We'll need to [search] the area first, and then build the [device].'\nYou say, 'What device?'\nSage Jarith says 'We can't build the device yet, we'll need to [search] the area first.'\nYou say, 'Let's search it then!'\nSage Jarith says 'Good, you'd like to get started? I'll do what I can from here and prepare the spells needed. You find any other trapped individuals you can, and tell me all you can find out about the rest of this horrid place.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Morell's Sanctuary'.\nYou've been asked to scour Morell's realm for other trapped dreamers. Find them and then convince them of their situation, and that they can escape if everyone works together.\n\n---\n\n_You'll want the following locations for your \"somnium.txt\" map file:_\nP -75.0000, 80.0000, -5.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Saeger\nP -430.0000, -10.0000, -24.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Fareth\\_Port\nP -305.0000, 145.0000, -25.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Rommen\nP -30.0000, 450.0000, 35.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Dennen\nP -665.0000, -520.0000, -21.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Mara\nP 290.0000, -10.0000, -25.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Cort\n_Or for in-game /locs:_\nSeager: -80, 75, -5 _(balcony across from the zone-in)_\nFareth: 10, 430, -24 _(portal at this location; Fareth is in the port-up area)_\nRommen: -145, 305, -25 _(treasure halls west of the zone-in)_\nDennen: -450, 30, 35 _(en route to Morell's Tower, south of the zone-in)_\nMara: 520, 665, -21 _(down a ladder in a west-central room in the undead area)_\nCort: 10, -290, -25 _(entrance area of the castle; east from the zone-in area)_\nSearch the entrance hall balconies 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind Seager the Locksmith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Seager the Locksmith'\nSeager the Locksmith says 'Am I glad to see a friendly face! I'm about to drop dead from fright. I can't find my way out of here, and none of my tools or keys can help if I can't find a proper passage! So you say you are with one of those magic-user types that can help us get out of here? By all means, then, let me know if I can help.'\nSearch the filthy, rundown village 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind Fareth 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Fareth'\nFareth says 'As if my life wasn't bad enough, I tell you. I found someplace nice to go to sleep and woke up in this place. You're trying to get out of here? If you find a way, please let me know. I just can't take this anymore.'\nSearch the halls filled with treasure 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind Rommen Steelforge 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Rommen Steelforge'\nRommen Steelforge says 'Some dark magic is at work here, I tell ya. This gold isn't real. Never seen anything like this in my life, I'll tell you that, and I've seen a lot. I may be tough, but I'm tough in business. I'm a merchant, not a fighter. So if you'd be so kind, I'd appreciate a hand out of here. If you think you've found a way, just let me know if there is anything I can do.'\nSearch the path to Morell's tower 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind Dennen Marol 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dennen Marol'\nDennen Marol says 'I know I shouldn't have meddled in necromancy! This plane is my punishment, I fear! They shall make me suffer before I die. What? You think you can get us out? I'd be forever grateful! My magic is at your command.'\nSearch the western underground maze-like dungeon entrance 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind Mara O`Rane 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mara O`Rane'\nMara O`Rane says 'I'm a big fan o` fighting, but even I'm getting a bit tired here. I can't seem to find my way out of these creepy tunnels. You say you can get us out of here? I'm at your service then. Just let me know if you need a hand. I want to go back home.'\nSearch the exquisite castle 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind Cort Landerson 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Cort Landerson'\nCort Landerson says 'This is unacceptable! I've never dealt with such irrational fools. Surely, we are in a bad situation. But that is no excuse to panic. The blood in my veins is noble, not that one of a frantic commoner. Ah, I see that you think you know a way out. Well if you find one, inform me. If I can help in anyway, do not hesitate to ask. Good teamwork is important, after all.'\nDefeat the tower wardens that guard the way 0/2 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Any two wardens will update this step._\nReturn to Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sage Jarith'\nSage Jarith says 'Very interesting. We may be able to use their help later, thankfully it sounded as if most were cooperative. I don't think we can do this ourselves. Now, based on the information you provided me of this area, I am going to start building the device to get us all out of here. I will need your help, of course.'\nYou've made contact with the trapped dreamers and done what you've can to get them to work together.\n_Rewards:_\n158 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream Motes\n_A second task, \"Dreamland Assault\", follows this one._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
