evice] that can dispel some of Morell's magic and hopefully weaken him. Finally, we'll use the device near that locked [tower] that seems so important. I have a feeling that's where Morell is hiding.'\nYou say, 'What about the device?'\nSage Jarith says 'Yes, let's get started on that. I'll need a number of components from around this dream world. Bring them to me as you find them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dreamland Assault'.\nJarith has asked you for your help in constructing a magical device that should weaken the tower's barriers. Find or take what you need to assist him.\n\n---\n\nGet tools from Seager the Locksmith and give them to Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Seager the Locksmith'\nSeager the Locksmith says 'So you need some tools? Here you go. Now why don't you tell that Sage that I'll give him the shirt off my back if it gets me out of this bad dream?'\nGet ghostly essence from the phantoms and give it to Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Essences are a common drop from dream phantoms in the undead area (northwest of the zone-in area)._\nFind bags of gold and deliver them to Jarith 0/5 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_These are ground spawns all throughout the leprechaun area west of the zone-in._\nAcquire magical components from Dennin and give them to Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dennen Marol'\nDennen Marol says 'A few magical components to get out of here? Please, take them! I'll never touch forbidden magic again! I just want to go home.'\nGet necessary potions from Rommen and give them to Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Rommen Steelforge'\nRommen Steelforge says 'Some potions and oils for my freedom from this world of false gold and dangerous magic-casting creatures? Best deal of my life. Take 'em. Tell that Sage to get to work. Time is money. Or in this case, safety.'\nTalk to Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sage Jarith'\nSage Jarith says 'You've done an excellent job, my friend! I have everything 