e near that locked [tower] that seems so important. I have a feeling that's where Morell is hiding.'\nYou say, 'What about the tower?'\nSage Jarith says 'This is it! Take the device, and bring it in close proximity to that inaccessible tower. My work will take it from there. Then, you'll need to deal with the forces Morell sends out. Good luck.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Key to the Tower'.\nJarith's actions have caused Morell to retaliate. Jarith believes that if the forces Morell has sent can be destroyed, Morell's power will significantly weaken.\n\n---\n\nGet the device from Jarith and bring it near the tower 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sage Jarith'\nSage Jarith says 'Here you are. Please don't lose or destroy it. Do you know how difficult this was to make? Good luck!'\n_With \"Sage's Dispel Device\" in hand, walk towards Morell's tower in the southern part of the zone (nothing will happen to you; you can do this while invis)._\nDefeat the tower wardens 0/3 (Sanctum Somnium)\nDefeat the tower servants 0/3 (Sanctum Somnium)\nDefeat the tower guardians 0/3 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Any wardens, servants, and guardians in the zone will update the above three steps._\nDefeat Morell's Commander 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_The Commander spawns outside the door to Morell's tower. He's a fairly straightforward fight. If you can handle trash in the zone, this will be simple enough._\nMorell`s Commander has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nMorell`s Commander's corpse lets out a death rattle and crumples to the floor.\nSpeak with Jarith 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sage Jarith'\nSage Jarith says 'As expected, you've done it. My knowledge and your power are a potent combination, my friend. Can't you feel it? Morell is quite distracted thanks to my device and your killing of a powerful creature he created. I'm sure you'll be able to access the tower now, but I must gather the others and escape here, now that we can. If you intended to face Morell, I wish you the best of luck.'\nMorell's dream world is starting to shudder, and he has lost control over most of the dreamers. Jarith and the others can escape now, but Morell still resides in his tower.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience (about 2 AAs worth)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n27 Dream Motes\n_Completion of this task leads into the first Sanctum Somnium mission, \"Morell's Challenge\"._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
