      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sanctum Somnium [zone=758]\n**Who:**\n- Buck Witherspoon [ _Mission_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sanctum Somnium: Morell's Challenge [zone=781]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- A Champion of Morell [npc=37072]\n- Buck Witherspoon [npc=37075]\n- Dreamfeeder [npc=37074]\n- Otraff [npc=37073]\n- Yngvar [npc=37071]\n- a blue beacon [npc=37082]\n- a purple beacon [npc=37085]\n- a red beacon [npc=37083]\n- a yellow beacon [npc=37084]\n- an orange beacon [npc=37081]\n- an ornate chest - Morell's Challenge [npc=37068]\n- cloud of death [npc=37069]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Jarith #1: Morell's Sanctuary [quest=5245]\n- Jarith #2: Dreamland Assault [quest=5246]\n- Jarith #3: The Key to the Tower [quest=5247]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 30 20:59:31 2010\nModified: Sat Sep 28 07:30:14 2024 | | _This is a group mission that begins with Buck Witherspoon in Sanctum Somnium. He's a centaur located on the balcony across from the zone-in._\n_You must have completed Sage Jarith's three solo tasks prior to being able to request this one._\nYou say, 'Hail, Buck Witherspoon'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'It is time again for Morell's challenge! Are you up to it? Riches can be yours if you complete this simple [challenge]!'\nYou say, 'What challenge?'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'It's quite straight forward really. All you have to do is race through the tower finding beacons and fighting some creatures along the way. Think you are up to [taking] the challenge?'\nYou say, 'I'm up for taking it on'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'I knew you were a champ! When you are ready to [start], let me know!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Morell's Challenge'.\nYou have entered Morell's Challenge, a deadly but possibly profitable race through the castle. Follow the green beacons to stay on track, but beware that some areas do not have green beacons and you will need to find your way through those locations on your own. Just make sure not to let the purple cloud of ultimate darkness catch up to you!\n_NOTE: The death touch \"mob\" and teleporters in this task can only be seen if you have NPC spell particle effects turned on. These are in the Options-Display menu and must be turned on before you zone in._\n_Say \"start\" to zone in._\nYou say, 'Ready to start...'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'This is going to be so much fun!'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Buck Witherspoon to start the challenge 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_NOTE: Make sure to follow all of Buck Witherspoon's dialogues here, otherwise the mission may get bugged._\nYou say, 'Hail, Buck Witherspoon'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'Ah yes, you probably wish to know the rules. Your task is to race through the tower. Along the way you will battle horrible monsters and have to find different colored beacons. The green beacons along the way will show you the correct path to take. Unfortunately the green beacons don't appear in every section of the tower, so you will have to find your own way through those areas on your own. You may have to make use of teleport areas to do so or to avoid hazards. That is where most people die a most unpleasant death, but I think you have the spunk to make it through! Oh, I almost forgot one more teeny tiny [detail].'\nYou say, 'Tiny detail?'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'Legalities and such mandate that I tell you about the cloud of ultimate death. Quite simply, it will be slowly creeping up behind you during the race. You may want to avoid it unless you want the flesh to melt off your bones. I am also legally bound to let you know that if you wish to chicken out and [leave], to let me know. If you are brave and want a chance to win some fabulous prizes however, we can begin when you are [ready].'\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'Let the games begin!'\n_Head through the treasure halls and use a teleporter to port to the castle area. The teleporter is found in one of the dead-ends of these halls._\nFind and defeat Yngvar the giant 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind and defeat Otraff the centaur 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind and defeat Dreamfeeder the shade 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind and defeat a Champion of Morell, the beefeater 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_The above-four nameds are found in the four rooms surrounding the courtyard. They each hit for a max ~14,000 and have no special abilities (no flurry, rampage, or enrage). They have a lot of hitpoints (about 1.35 million worth) and all see invisible._\n_WARNING: The DT cloud may be present in this area, so you'll want to keep an eye out for that._\n_After the last named is dead, a teleporter appears next to the fountain. Use it to port to the undead area._\nFind the orange beacon 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind the blue beacon 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind the red beacon 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind the purple beacon 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nFind the yellow beacon 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_The beacons appear as orbs on the ground and are found in different locations throughout the area. You just need to walk over them in order to update these steps._\n_Locations for somnium.txt map file:_\nP -570.0000, -350.0000, 20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, purple\nP -285.0000, -545.0000, 20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, yellow\nP -285.0000, -660.0000, 20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, orange\nP -705.0000, -660.0000, 22.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, red\nP -610.0000, -430.0000, 22.0000, 0, 0, 0, 1, blue\n_In-game /locs:_\nPurple: 350, 570, 20 _(a room in the south section)_\nYellow: 545, 285, 20 _(a room in the north section)_\nOrange: 660, 285, 20 _(a room in the north section)_\nRed: 660, 705, 22 _(a room in the south section)_\nBlue: 430, 610, 22 _(a dead-end hall in the south section)_\nSpeak with Buck Witherspoon 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Buck Witherspoon spawns in the circular room attached to the northeast part of the undead area (as does the chest)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Buck Witherspoon'\nBuck Witherspoon says 'We have a winner! You are now one of the proud few who have survived Morell's Challenge and not ended up getting destroyed by the cloud of ultimate darkness! I promised you a reward if you lived through the challenge, so make sure to loot the treasure chest for your reward before you [leave]!'\nCollect your rewards from the ornate chest 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Task Rewards:_\n310 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n80 Dream Motes [item=90255]\n_Known Chest Loot [npc=37068] (1 item + 1 spell per task):_\nAmethyst Ward of the Companion\nBeast King's Scepter\nRosch's Metal Stud\nSavage Spiritblade\nShieldbearer's Lance\nSpellward Knuckleguard\nTwisted Dream Shield\nUmbrage\nVery Unlucky Feral Hare's Foot\nWarped Chitin Bow\nMinor Nebulous Dream Fragment\nLesser Nebulous Dream Fragment\nMedian Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGreater Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGlowing Nebulous Dream Fragment\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
