e I said, you will be rewarded for your efforts. What do you [say]?'\nYou say, 'I say let's do this'\nSalvonius says 'Good. I knew you would be up to it. Otherwise, I would have you thrown into the dungeon. Now, let's keep this on the down-low. If anyone asks, we have never seen each other. Head into the trove and obtain the items I seek. They should be lying amongst the piles of gold. I shall await your return. Oh, and be careful. I wouldn't want any of the treasure to get damaged.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Stash and Go'.\nSalvonius has had his eye on some valuable items in Morell's treasure trove and would like you to steal them for him.\n\n---\n\n_The kill steps and groundspawns in this task are all found in the treasure halls in the west part of the zone (which, incidentally, are full of see-invis leprechauns)._\n_You'll want the following map points for your \"somnium.txt\" map file:_\nP -190.0000, 230.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Stein\nP -265.0000, 220.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Shield\nP -180.0000, 295.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Elixir\nP -515.0000, 330.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Shard\nP -60.0000, 360.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Bow\nP -265.0000, 265.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Sword\nP -180.0000, 375.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Shield\nP -335.0000, 405.0000, -26.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Dreamraze\nP -695.0000, -500.0000, 20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Pit\nP -250.0000, -665.0000, 20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Pit\nP -695.0000, -500.0000, -20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Ladder\nP -250.0000, -665.0000, -20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Ladder\nP -335.0000, -660.0000, 20.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Chest\nProtect the treasure by killing goblins 0/2 (Sanctum Somnium)\nProtect the treasure by killing leprechauns 0/2 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal an Elaborate Stein from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal a Nightmarish Shield from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal a Deathshattering Bow from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal an Elixir of Dreams from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal a Shard of Storms from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal a Savage Shield from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal a Dreamraze from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSteal a Cloudy Sword of Dominion from Morell's treasure trove 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nReturn to Salvonius and speak with him 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Task Window Says:_ Salvonius has asked you to place the Elaborate Stein, Nightmarish Shield, Deathshattering Bow, Elixir of Dreams, Shard of Storms, Savage Shield, Dreamraze, and Sword of Cloudy Dominion in his personal treasure chest in the maze-like hallways.\n_\"Salvonius Treasure Chest\" can be found in the undead area. It's in the second room over from the northeasternmost room on your map. You'll have to go down into the pit and travel to the other side in order to get there._\nPlace the Elaborate Stein in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Nightmarish Shield in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Deathshattering Bow in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Elixir of Dreams in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Shard of Storms in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Savage Shield in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Dreamraze in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nPlace the Cloudy Sword of Dominion in Salvonius' treasure chest for safe keeping 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nSpeak with Salvonius 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n27 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
